<div id="recipe-35722-instructions" class="wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-35722-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal" data-recipe="35722"><h3 class="wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none" style="">Instructions</h3><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-35722-step-0-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Preheat oven to 350 degrees F.</div></li></ul></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><h4 class="wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-instruction-group-name wprm-block-text-bold">To prepare the apples:</h4><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-35722-step-1-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Place apples, maple syrup, lemon juice, ground cinnamon, kosher salt, and arrowroot powder in a bowl. Give it a stir. Place it in a 9 or 10-inch baking dish.</div></li></ul></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><h4 class="wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-instruction-group-name wprm-block-text-bold">To prepare the crisp:</h4><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-35722-step-2-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Mix together the rolled oats, almond flour, shredded coconut, ground cinnamon, kosher salt, coconut oil, maple syrup and pecans in a bowl. Mix until well combined.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-vegan-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Person making crumb topping." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-vegan-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-vegan-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-vegan-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-vegan-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-vegan.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-vegan.jpg"></div> </li></ul></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><h4 class="wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-instruction-group-name wprm-block-text-bold">To Assemble &amp; Bake:</h4><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-35722-step-3-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Distribute the crisp topping onto the apples in an even layer.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Vegan-apple-dessert-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Collage of images showing the assembly of the apple crisp." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Vegan-apple-dessert-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Vegan-apple-dessert-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Vegan-apple-dessert-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Vegan-apple-dessert-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Vegan-apple-dessert.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Vegan-apple-dessert.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-35722-step-3-1" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Bake for 40-45 minutes or until the topping turns lightly golden.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-no-butter-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Freshly baked apple crisp from the top view." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-no-butter-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-no-butter-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-no-butter-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-no-butter-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-no-butter.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Apple-crisp-recipe-no-butter.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-35722-step-3-2" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Serve with a scoop of vanilla ice cream or a cup of almond milk on the side.</div></li></ul></div></div>
